.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success; 1 when a command fails (the message names the cause) or doctor finds a failing check; Commander's usage errors exit with its own status.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBDISPLAY\fR
The X display the wallpaper and visualizers go on.
.TP
\fBPEXELS_API\fR
The Pexels API key, when sources.pexels.api_key is not set.
.TP
\fBXDG_CONFIG_HOME, XDG_DATA_HOME, XDG_CACHE_HOME, XDG_RUNTIME_DIR\fR
Where the files above live. Pointing them at a scratch directory runs backdrop without touching the real library.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/backdrop/config.yaml\fR
The configuration (default ~/.config); see backdrop\-config(5).
.TP
\fI$XDG_DATA_HOME/backdrop/backdrop.db\fR
The library database: items, ratings, searches, tags (default ~/.local/share).
.TP
\fI$XDG_DATA_HOME/backdrop/backdrop.log\fR
The log, JSON lines.
.TP
\fI$XDG_DATA_HOME/backdrop/media, trash, inbox\fR
Kept items, skipped ones until library.trash_days have passed, and unrated downloads.
.TP
\fI$XDG_CACHE_HOME/backdrop/thumbnails, bounce, smooth\fR
Thumbnails, reversed copies for bounce and smoothed copies of slowed videos (default ~/.cache).
.TP
\fI$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/backdrop\fR
The running daemon's state.json, mpv sockets, control requests and children.json; falls back to $TMPDIR/backdrop\-UID.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Start the daemon and see what plays:
.PP
.RS
.nf
backdrop start
backdrop status
.fi
.RE
.PP
Import local folders, then show only videos:
.PP
.RS
.nf
backdrop import ~/wallpaper/video
backdrop mode video
.fi
.RE
.PP
Rate what plays on the monitor under the pointer:
.PP
.RS
.nf
backdrop keep 2
backdrop skip
backdrop undo
.fi
.RE
.PP
Next item with a tag, kept until cleared:
.PP
.RS
.nf
backdrop next \-\-tag ocean
backdrop next \-\-clear
.fi
.RE
.PP
Search Pexels and download what was found into the inbox:
.PP
.RS
.nf
PEXELS_API=... backdrop search\-videos "rain window"
backdrop download
.fi
.RE
.PP
Run the daemon from systemd:
.PP
.RS
.nf
backdrop systemd > ~/.config/systemd/user/backdrop.service
systemctl \-\-user enable \-\-now backdrop
.fi
.RE
.PP
Check the setup, naming the fix for each problem:
.PP
.RS
.nf
backdrop doctor
.fi
.RE
